        "zh-CN": "青蓝与琥珀细流围绕偏心涡核交错，细点沿流线闪动。低频扭动涡核，中频改变丝线亮度，高频激活光点。两个可编辑图像 Shader、三宏与四段配乐；为解析式粒子外观，不是物理粒子模拟。",
        "en-US": "Cyan and amber filaments spiral around an offset core. Bass twists the field, mids brighten strands and highs activate sparks. Two editable image shaders, three macros and four music cues; analytic particle appearance, not physical particle simulation."
